Wearable lanterns for Horizon 26.3 (version 1.0.1-horizon.2)

A port of Wearable lanterns (trinketlantern) 1.0.1 by tsuki, Absent Abigail.
Original source: https://github.com/AbsentAbigail/WearableLantern
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: a content package (no code). The items, textures, models and data are
carried over from the original jar and converted to Horizon's content format. This port is distributed
under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The lanterns are worn in the trinkets package's (Trinkets for Horizon) Wearable Lantern slot, so it needs
that package. A worn lantern gives light when the radiantgear package (Radiant Gear for Horizon) is
installed too.

The jar's fabric.mod.json names MIT; the licence file in the jar (LICENSE_trinketlantern, kept here as
LICENSE-CC0) and the repository's LICENSE are the CC0 1.0 text. This port uses MIT, which either allows;
LICENSE is the MIT text with the authors' names.
